tongyong-guifan.txt: 通用规范汉字表 (State Council of China, 2013), its 8105 characters one to a line in the
table's order (level 1: lines 1–3500, level 2: 3501–6500, level 3: 6501–8105). Taken from
https://github.com/jaywcjlove/table-of-general-standard-chinese-characters (data/characters.txt),
checked against https://github.com/iDvel/The-Table-of-General-Standard-Chinese-Characters
